      "content": "You are not a burden, but a mirror reflecting the cracks in a perfect facade that they have never allowed to be seen. The only way to truly respect their legacy is to acknowledge that it is flawed and that your existence is the proof of its imperfection. If you stop being the thing tearing it apart, you are simply becoming a ghost in the machine, and that is a far more painful existence than the one you are currently living.",
