      "content": "i don't want to be a ghost. i just want it to be over. the weight of it all... it's so heavy. if i could just go away, if i could just erase myself from their history, maybe they could finally be whole again. wouldn't that be the most selfless thing i could actually do? to just let them have their perfection back without me ruining it?",
